    "solution": "Hop into a down-right wavedash and jump out low beneath the thorn roof. As the incoming pulse reaches the shaft, parry straight up to the receiver above. Continue right and use the preserved airborne dash after the roof ends, crossing the orbiting patrol to the far bank. Catch the side, climb over its lip and leave through the opened door. The receiver is physically shielded from a ground-level reply; the launch supplies the low moving interception.",
